        <mxCell id="c113" value="&lt;b&gt;YTD&lt;/b&gt;, a visual calculation:&lt;br&gt;RUNNINGSUM ( [Net Income] )&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Net Income YTD&lt;/b&gt;, a measure:&lt;br&gt;TOTALYTD ( [Net Income], &#x27;Date&#x27;[Date] )&lt;br&gt;Over the twelve months of one year they read alike in every row and reach 4,503,611.24 in December." style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F6F3;strokeColor=#E8F6F3;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="606" y="16" width="230" height="134" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c114" value="" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#117A65;strokeColor=#117A65;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="606" y="16" width="5" height="134" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c115" value="&lt;b&gt;With January to June filtered out&lt;/b&gt;, YTD starts again at July and reaches 2,150,939.31 in December, the sum of the six rows it can see. Net Income YTD reads the model&#x27;s dates, so it shows 2,467,193.90 in July and 4,503,611.24 in December." style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF5E7;strokeColor=#FEF5E7;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="606" y="348" width="230" height="119" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c116" value="" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#8A5D00;strokeColor=#8A5D00;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="606" y="348" width="5" height="119" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c117" value="Ledger Detail" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5D8DC;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="4" y="554" width="93.364" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c118" value="&lt;b&gt;Ex 15.2&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1A5276;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1A5276;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="99.364" y="554" width="63.364" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c119" value="Ex 15.3" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5D8DC;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="164.728" y="554" width="62.692" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c120" value="&lt;b&gt;+&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5D8DC;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="229.42" y="554" width="26" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c121" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 15.2, filtered to 2026. Outlined in teal: the two year-to-date columns, equal in every month. Outlined in coral: the December cells of the second table, where they differ. YTD and Change are visual calculations, computed inside the visual: the project cannot read them, so the cells show the running sum and the difference from the row above. January&#x27;s Change, which has no row above it, is left empty: the project does not hold what Desktop shows there. Total rows are not drawn, and neither is the page&#x27;s text box.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="584" width="860" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
